O|
G,M|               A MONTAGE that carries us from JUNE TO AUGUST. A few notes:          
M|               this montage cannot be about tying things up neatly. That            
M|               would be a complete betrayal of this place and the community.        
M|               Instead, it should be glimpses into the lives of the people          
M|               we’ve spent time with along the way. Impressionistic snatches        
M|               filled with equal measures of sadness, loneliness,                   
M|               uncertainty, heartbreak, laughter, kindness, compassion,             
M|               love, and mercy. And we might hear bits of dialogue that             
M|               don’t make sense or seem meaningless at the time. That’s             
M|               okay, too. We’re simply bearing witness. Showing that life           
M|               goes on. That they’re doing the best they can.                       
